<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[Hey there,<div><br></div><div>You are officially submitted out! Here's a few things I like to remind all my travelers about the interview process.</div><div><br></div><div>The
 facility might call you, email you, or text you - so be on the lookout 
for all three. Any communication you have with someone from the 
facility, reach out to me immediately for an update. Even if you miss a 
call! :-)</div><div><br></div><div>Things to write down:</div><div>*Managers Name:</div><div>*Managers Number:</div><div>*Start Date:</div><div>*Requested time off:</div><div>*Length of assignment:</div><div>*Shift information (times/call etc.):</div><div>*Any other information you feel I need to know, have questions about, or why you wouldn't immediately accept:</div><div><br></div><div>Don't
 be afraid to ask for the job travel managers love that! Or if there's 
anything you're hesitant about, please ask them at the interview and let
 me know as well.</div><div><br></div><div>I'm really excited for you and us starting this journey together.</div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>